b='https://www.bcu.ac.uk/international/fees-costs-and-scholarships/';tw='https://www.bcu.ac.uk/international/bcu-in-your-country/taiwan';dates='https://www.bcu.ac.uk/international/your-application/key-dates'
rows=[dict(key='aston',slug='2026-11-aston-pg-international-community-january-2027',title='Aston一月碩士國際社群獎：首年學費減£4,000，先留意11月30日入學申請期限',en='Aston January postgraduate community scholarship: £4,000 tuition discount; course applications by November 30',official='https://www.aston.ac.uk/international/scholarships',second='https://kwahub.com/en/study-abroad-scholarships/1754-aston-university-postgraduate-international-community-scholarship-january-2027',level=('授課型碩士','Taught master’s'),funding=('首年學費減免£4,000','£4,000 first-year tuition discount'),deadline=('課程申請2026-11-30；訂金依個人錄取信','Course application November 30, 2026; deposit per offer'),more=[('Aston — January 2027 formal terms','https://www.aston.ac.uk/sites/default/files/PG%20ICS%20Terms%20and%20Conditions%20January%202027.pdf'),('Aston — Taiwan entry','https://www.aston.ac.uk/international/taiwan'),('Aston — current admissions deadlines','https://www.aston.ac.uk/postgraduate/how-to-apply')],paras=[
('可以減少哪些費用','What the award covers','Aston University的Postgraduate International Community Scholarship，為2027年1月在伯明罕校區就讀合適全日制授課型碩士的新生，提供首年£4,000學費減免。不是生活費、現金或整個學位全額資助；後續學年沒有自動續領承諾。校方採條件符合後自動給予的方式，沒有另外的競爭申請表。','Aston’s Postgraduate International Community Scholarship offers a £4,000 first-year tuition discount for eligible full-time taught postgraduate entrants at its Birmingham campus in January 2027. It is not living-cost funding, cash or a full scholarship, and does not promise renewal. It is automatic once conditions are met, with no separate competitive application.'),
('台灣申請者的資格','Eligibility for Taiwanese applicants','台灣學生可循校方台灣入學頁申請，仍須獲認定為Overseas學費身分、第一年入學並自費就讀，完成學術、英語及非學術錄取條件。雇主、政府或其他第三方的全部或部分資助通常使申請者不符合自費定義；除非校方與資助方有明確書面協議，不應自行推定可併領。','Taiwanese applicants have a published admissions route but must hold Overseas fee status, enter the first year, be self-funded and satisfy academic, language and other offer conditions. Full or partial employer, government or other third-party support normally excludes self-funded status unless a specific written agreement establishes eligibility.'),
('期限與啟用條件','Deadlines and activation','當日官方招生頁明列仍接受2027年1月申請，最終課程申請日為2026年11月30日；熱門課程可提前額滿。接受錄取與繳訂金的期限依個人錄取信。按時付訂金只是啟動評估，仍須取得CAS及合適簽證、完成註冊與到校要求，折扣才正式生效。不要把入學申請日和訂金日當成同一天。','The current admissions page accepts January 2027 applications until November 30, 2026, subject to earlier course closure. Offer acceptance and deposit deadlines are individual. Timely payment triggers consideration, while CAS, an appropriate visa and successful enrolment and attendance are required for activation. Application and deposit deadlines are separate.'),
('排除與變更規則','Exclusions and changes','MBA、MRes、研究型課程、OSPAP及MSc Physician Associate Practice不適用；有獨立合作獎助安排的銜接路徑也排除。原則上同一課程持一項校方獎助，例外須校方明示。延期入學不能把本期獎項自動帶到下一期。官方11頁條款優先於其他宣傳，本頁以KwaHub的當期整理交叉核對，並非保證錄取或獲獎。','MBA, MRes, research programmes, OSPAP and MSc Physician Associate Practice are excluded, as are progression routes with separate partnership funding. Normally one institutional award applies unless an exception is expressly approved. Deferral does not carry the award to another intake. The eleven-page terms take precedence over publicity; KwaHub corroborates the current scheme, without guaranteeing admission or funding.')]),
dict(key='bcuug',slug='2026-11-bcu-international-undergraduate-january-2027',title='Birmingham City學士獎學金：兩年合計減£5,000，一月入學申請仍開放',en='Birmingham City undergraduate scholarship: £5,000 across two years, January applications open',official=b+'ug-scholarships',second='https://www.idp.com/scholarship/birmingham-city-university/undergraduate-scholarships/148287/',level=('學士','Undergraduate'),funding=('首年£3,000、第二年£2,000學費減免','£3,000 year one and £2,000 year two tuition discount'),deadline=('台灣居住地：課程申請2026-12-04；CAS訂金12-11','Taiwan domicile: course application December 4; CAS deposit December 11, 2026'),more=[('BCU — Taiwan eligibility',tw),('BCU — January admission deadlines',dates),('British Global — independent course and funding guide','https://britishglobal.co.uk/en/birmingham-city-university')],paras=[
('補助如何分年使用','How the discount is divided','Birmingham City University為符合條件的自費國際學士新生提供合計£5,000學費減免：第一年£3,000、第二年£2,000。這不是第一年一次領£5,000，也不含住宿或生活費。官方方案涵蓋2026年9月及2027年1月；本次新增只推薦尚未開始的2027年1月途徑，不能套用到尚未公告的2027年9月。','Eligible self-funded international undergraduate entrants receive £5,000 in tuition discounts: £3,000 in year one and £2,000 in year two. It is not a £5,000 first-year payment or living-cost support. The published scheme covers September 2026 and January 2027; this listing focuses on the still-open January route and does not extend it to September 2027.'),
('台灣學生與入學條件','Taiwan eligibility and admission','官方台灣頁明列本獎，並提供台灣學歷的入學路徑，證據不只來自「國際生」泛稱。須首次在BCU就讀合適全日制學士、自費並符合國際學費身分。台灣高中畢業證書本身不等於一定可直接入學；官方列學科成績加副學士／專科條件，另有科系與英語要求，應交由校方評估個人學歷。','BCU’s Taiwan page explicitly lists the award and recognised qualifications, rather than relying only on a generic international-student label. Applicants must be new eligible full-time undergraduates, self-funded and paying international fees. A Taiwanese school-leaving certificate alone does not establish direct entry; the published route includes additional associate/junior-college qualifications and subject and English requirements.'),
('仍開放的時程','The current application window','官方一月入學時程把台灣居住地列入其他國家組：2026年12月4日入學申請截止、12月11日CAS訂金截止、12月23日最後發CAS、2027年1月25日開課。學校按居住地分類，其他居住地可能更早。獎學金不用額外申請，會在錄取信顯示並於註冊後帳單扣減；發CAS前仍要求支付全年完整學費的50%，不能先扣獎學金計算。','For Taiwan domicile, the January timeline falls under all other countries: applications December 4, CAS deposit December 11, final CAS December 23 and teaching January 25, 2027. Different domiciles may have earlier deadlines. No separate scholarship form is needed; the offer records it and the enrolled student’s invoice applies it. The pre-CAS payment remains 50% of the full annual tuition fee.'),
('哪些課程不適用','Excluded routes','皇家伯明罕音樂學院的音樂與表演、預科及學士以下課程、合作機構課程、加速學位、兼讀、短期與交換等排除。由BCU或BCUIC預科升讀的學生也不適用本項。不能與其他BCU獎學金疊加，符合多項通常取較高者。IDP確認一月2027與£5,000，細部資格以校方當期條款為準；符合基本條件仍須完成錄取與註冊。','Exclusions include Royal Birmingham Conservatoire music and acting, foundation and sub-degree routes, partner provision, accelerated degrees, part-time, short and exchange study. Progression from BCU or BCUIC foundation programmes is also excluded. BCU awards do not stack; normally the higher applies. IDP corroborates January 2027 and £5,000, while current institutional terms govern detailed eligibility and enrolment.')]),
dict(key='bcupg',slug='2026-11-bcu-international-postgraduate-january-2027',title='Birmingham City授課型碩士獎：學費減£3,000，台灣申請者須核對居住地期限',en='Birmingham City taught postgraduate scholarship: £3,000 tuition reduction; check domicile deadlines',official=b+'pg-scholarships',second='https://britishglobal.co.uk/en/birmingham-city-university',level=('授課型碩士','Taught master’s'),funding=('學費減免£3,000','£3,000 tuition discount'),deadline=('台灣居住地：課程申請2026-12-04；CAS訂金12-11','Taiwan domicile: course application December 4; CAS deposit December 11, 2026'),more=[('BCU — Taiwan eligibility',tw),('BCU — January admission deadlines',dates)],paras=[
('學費支持的範圍','Scope of tuition support','Birmingham City University的國際研究所獎，提供£3,000學費減免，適用2027年1月首次就讀合適全日制授課型碩士的自費國際新生。這是與學士方案不同學位層級的獎項，不把同一獎重複拆成多個新增。沒有另外獎學金表格，金額與資格應見於正式錄取文件；本獎不是生活費或現金給付。','BCU’s international postgraduate scholarship provides a £3,000 tuition discount for eligible self-funded international entrants on full-time taught master’s courses in January 2027. It is a separate degree-level award from the undergraduate scheme, not a duplicate listing of one scholarship. No separate form is required; formal offer documents should confirm eligibility and value. It is not cash or maintenance support.'),
('台灣資格與課程要求','Taiwan eligibility and course requirements','校方台灣頁直接列出£3,000研究所獎，並列台灣學士入學參考為總成績65%或GPA2.3／4.0；部分科系仍要求相關本科、作品集或研究計畫，英語也可能高於一般門檻。這些是入學參考，不是讓所有達成績的人自動取得任何課程錄取。獎項另要求國際學費身分、自費與合適課程。','The official Taiwan page explicitly lists the £3,000 award and a general bachelor’s-degree threshold of 65% or GPA 2.3/4.0. Some programmes require a relevant degree, portfolio or proposal and higher English scores. These are admissions references, not automatic admission to any course. International fee status, self-funding and an eligible programme remain necessary.'),
('入學與付款期限','Admission and payment deadlines','當日官方時程仍列2027年1月申請：台灣居住地適用其他國家組，12月4日申請、12月11日CAS訂金，開課為1月25日。若住在另一個須提早面談的國家，應按該組期限處理。獎學金在註冊後從發票扣減，發CAS前須先支付完整年學費50%；不要把£3,000折扣當成能替代這筆先期付款。','January 2027 applications remain listed. Taiwan domicile uses the all-other-countries dates: December 4 for application, December 11 for the CAS deposit and January 25 for teaching. Residence in an earlier-interview group changes the timetable. The discount is applied after enrolment; 50% of the full annual tuition fee is still due before CAS and cannot be replaced by the award.'),
('研究型與其他排除','Research and other exclusions','MRes、PhD、EdD等研究型課程、皇家伯明罕音樂學院、MSc Accounting and Finance top-up、PGCE、碩士以下課程、合作及兼讀、線上、短期課程等不適用。BCUIC碩士先修銜接也排除。多項BCU獎助原則取最高額，不相加。British Global的10月29日整理交叉確認£3,000及一月2027適用，最終仍以校方錄取與當期條款為準。','Research programmes including MRes, PhD and EdD, the Conservatoire, MSc Accounting and Finance top-up, PGCE, sub-master’s, partner, part-time, online and short courses are excluded, as is progression from a BCUIC pre-master’s. Multiple BCU awards normally resolve to the highest rather than accumulate. British Global’s October 29 guide corroborates the £3,000 January scheme; official current terms and offers remain decisive.')])]
